---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact – KIPROD"
  description="Start an institutional discussion with KIPROD—governance conversations, capability development, and partnership progression."
  activePath="/contact"
>
  <section class="about">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-tag">
Contact KIPROD
</div>

<h1 class="section-heading">
Start an
<em>Institutional Conversation</em>
</h1>

<p class="section-sub">
Every KIPROD engagement begins with understanding your institution's
governance, operational priorities, capability needs, and strategic
objectives. Let's discuss how we can support your journey.
</p>

</div>

</section>
<section class="about" style="background:var(--cream);">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-tag">
Engagement Pathways
</div>

<h2 class="section-heading">
How We Can
<em>Support Your Institution</em>
</h2>

<p class="section-sub">
Whether you are beginning with institutional discovery or seeking
long-term performance support, KIPROD provides structured engagement
pathways aligned to your priorities.
</p>

<div class="implementation-grid">

<div class="implementation-card">
<div class="implementation-number">01</div>
<h3>Institutional Capability Assessment</h3>
<p>Begin with ILCA and discover your institution's governance and capability priorities.</p>
</div>

<div class="implementation-card">
<div class="implementation-number">02</div>
<h3>Academy Programmes</h3>
<p>Capability development aligned to assessment findings.</p>
</div>

<div class="implementation-card">
<div class="implementation-number">03</div>
<h3>RMS Implementation</h3>
<p>Translate recommendations into measurable operational outcomes.</p>
</div>

<div class="implementation-card">
<div class="implementation-number">04</div>
<h3>Command Centre</h3>
<p>Continuous monitoring, executive visibility and institutional improvement.</p>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>

  <section class="institutional" style="border-top: 0">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="institutional-inner">
        <div>
          <div class="section-tag reveal">Contact</div>
          <h2 class="section-heading reveal">Begin the <em>conversation</em></h2>
          <p class="inst-desc reveal">
            Use the form to start an institutional discussion. We keep inquiries confidential and can structure
            engagements under NDA where appropriate.
          </p>
          <p class="inst-desc reveal">
            Email: <strong>info@kiprodrisk.co.ke</strong>
            <br />
            Regional Hub: <strong>Nairobi, KE</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="inst-form reveal">
          <div class="form-heading">Request an Institutional Engagement</div>
          <div class="form-sub">Complete the form below and our team will arrange a confidential institutional discussion..</div>

          <form>
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Full Name *</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" name="full_name" required placeholder="John Martin Ambetsa" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Institution Name *</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" name="institution_name" required placeholder="Your Institution" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Role / Title *</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="text" name="role_title" required placeholder="CEO / Credit Manager" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Email Address *</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@institution.org" />
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Phone Number *</label>
                <input class="form-input" type="tel" name="phone" required placeholder="+254 700 000 000" />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label class="form-label">Type of Institution (Dropdown) *</label>
                <select class="form-select" name="institution_type" required>
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Select type</option>
                  <option value="Commercial Bank">Commercial Bank</option>
                  <option value="Sacco">Sacco</option>
                  <option value="Microfinance Institution">Microfinance Institution</option>
                  <option value="Development Finance Institution">Development Finance Institution</option>
                  <option value="Government Institution">Government Institution</option>
                  <option value="Regulator">Regulator</option>
                  <option value="Fintech>Fintech</option>
                  <option value="Insurance Company">Insurance Company</option>
                  <option value="NGO">NGO</option>
                  <option value="Corporate Organisation">Corporate Organisation</option>
                  <option value="Other">Other</option>

                </select>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">Area of Interest (Dropdown) *</label>
              <select class="form-select" name="area_of_interest" required>
                <option value="Institutional Capability Assessment (ILCA)">Institutional Capability Assessment (ILCA)</option>
                <option value="Governance Visibility Review">Governance Visibility Review</option>
                <option value="Academy Programmes">Academy Programmes</option>
                <option value="Credit Risk & Portfolio Management">Credit Risk & Portfolio Management</option>
                <option value="RMS Implementation">RMS Implementation</option>
                <option value="Command Centre">Command Centre</option>
                <option value="Executive Advisory">Executive Advisory</option>
                <option value="Partnership Opportunities">Partnership Opportunities</option>
                <option value="Other">Other</option>

              </select>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">Institutional Priorities *</label>
              <textarea
                class="form-textarea"
                name="need_description"
                required
                placeholder="Tell us about your governance, operational, capability or strategic priorities."
              ></textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <label class="form-label">Preferred Contact Method</label>
              <input
                class="form-input"
                type="text"
                name="preferred_meeting_time"
                required
                placeholder="e.g. Weekday mornings, afternoons"
              />
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="form-submit">Submit Request →</button>
            <div class="form-sub" style="margin-top: 10px">
              By submitting, you are starting an institutional discussion. We respond within 2 business days.
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="mini-panel" style="margin-top:30px;background:var(--cream);">

<div class="mini-title">
Confidential by Design
</div>

<p class="mini-note">

Every enquiry is treated confidentially. Initial discussions focus on
understanding your institution's priorities before recommending any
assessment, learning, advisory, or implementation pathway.

</p>

</div>

  <section class="institutional" style="padding-top: 70px; padding-bottom: 70px">
    <div class="section-inner">
      <div class="section-tag reveal">What happens next</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading reveal">What Happens Next</h2>
      <p class="section-sub reveal">
        Once we receive your enquiry, our team reviews your institutional priorities, confirms the most appropriate engagement pathway, and schedules a confidential discussion. From there, we recommend the next steps based on your governance, capability, operational, and strategic objectives.
      </p>
      <div style="margin-top: 18px" class="reveal">
        <a href="/about" class="nav-cta" style="text-decoration: none">Explore the KIPROD Methodology →</a>
        <span style="display:inline-block; width: 10px"></span>
        <a href="/partnerships" class="arm-link">Review engagement phases →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
